ReasonforDeviation_Q3:
High teenage pregnancy rate as teenagers are prone to having low birth weight babies;
Infections during pregnancy and conditions such as poorly managed Hypertension due to patient factors (poor adherence, un-booked), preeclampsia, etc.
 MUAC not done and not interpreted correctly;
Poor referral for nutritional supplements;
Alcohol consumption, smoking habits and substance abuse during pregnancy;

