All pregnant women to have MUAC measurement done 
during their 1st ANC visit;
Public health education and awareness on danger signs during pregnancy; 
Sustain the nutritional needs by providing pregnant women with iron preparation and micronutrients;
Improve the management of obstetric conditions during pregnancy.

