ReasonforDeviation_Q3:
Prematurity with gross abnormalities and complications;
Babies born with congenital abnormalities including cardiac lesions;
Increase in stillbirths of viable fetuses with varying weights ( > 500 g to over 2kg);
Sepsis secondary to Gastro-enteritis advanced stage;
Maternal behaviour - not attending ANC; substance abuse; readiness for child rearing (immaturity, teenage pregnancy);
Increased incidence of meningitis amongst babies – HIV exposed;

CorrectiveAction_Q3:
Focusing on maternal education and awareness
 in pregnancy progression, identification of problems and early detection in ANC;
Employing the services of peer educators to assist with educational and awareness programs;
Creating an open channel for referral and consultation for referring facilities.

